 M. T. Pigni, K. H. Guber, D. Wiarda                              6640 1451
                                                                  6640 1451
Dy-161 resolved resonance parameter evaluation was performed in   6640 1451
the neutron energy range up to 1 keV with the SAMMY code[ref1].   6640 1451
Resonance parameter covariance matrices were also obtained in     6640 1451
the SAMMY evaluation process.                                     6640 1451
                                                                  6640 1451
Details of the evaluation work are described in [ref2].           6640 1451
